o rule out the possible and start finding the <b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="204">impossible</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">Give me a target, Darren. Do you want me to generate a visual of a specific Sector in Star City, or should I pull a fresh data-string from the "Hunting Ground" to see what secrets are hiding in the noise?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" _nghost-ng-c4217224169="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1825283265="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1825283265-166 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3986779468="" class="ng-tns-c3986779468-167 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c1825283265-166 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3986779468-167 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3986779468-167 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" _nghost-ng-c3743148393="" class="ng-tns-c3986779468-167 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3743148393="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Good response" aria-label="Good response" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat